# No testing unless asked

Do not run tests, start a server, or open a browser to verify work unless the user explicitly asks to test.

- Do not run `node --test`, `node --check`, or any other test or lint command.
- Do not start a static server or use browser tools to play, click, or listen.
- Still update test expectations when behaviour changes, so the suite stays accurate. Leave running it to the user.
